    "Comment": "Reflex Shot (RTO-T111): ends the turn, then at once fires one real shot at a randomly chosen enemy in weapon range and line of sight - no facing, no waiting as a reaction. The mod's assembly (ReflexShot.cs) picks the target and fires it from a postfix on AbilityEffectRunAction.Apply, scoped to this ability; its Actions list is deliberately empty.",
